ons locate evidence and do not demand equal layouts. A page ending earlier or a region outside this window is not itself content loss. For regenerated pages the reference establishes purpose, not a copied content inventory. Use component context and the stated dynamic/advertising exclusions. Do not infer interaction failures."}, "region_role_interpretation": "Before deciding whether a visual difference is a defect, identify its role. Distinguish the actual web-page interface from an interface depicted INSIDE an illustration, device mockup, screenshot, video, canvas or product demonstration. Text/advertising shown inside an animated example screen may change or disappear between frames; this is not loss of the actual page's information when its surrounding explanation, product meaning and real controls remain intact. Likewise allow changing advertising creatives and coherent carousel slides. This does not excuse missing actual page headings, descriptive text, editorial/product imagery, or essential real action labels. An animated background does not make overlaid actual-page text optional. Judge the role from the screenshots together with the saved component context; do not classify every empty region or broken editorial image as an animation.", "regenerated_purpose_requirements": "For regenerated pages, coherent text-only news or event cards are allowed. Do not infer a broken image merely from an unillustrated card or empty stylistic space. A source illustration need not be reproduced. Cropped illustrative poster imagery is not material loss when its title, date and essential information remain available as legible page text. Reject observable broken resources, unintelligible essential information or unusable actual controls; do not reject a usable target simply for sparse imagery, a different design or optional source omissions.", "page_purpose_outline": {"instruction": "These saved DOM headings clarify the whole-page purpose, including sections outside this visual window. Card image elements and decorative placeholders describe the saved structure, not successful image loading. A text-only card without an image element is not a broken image. These records are not proof that target text is visible. Assess actual legibility and material loss from the screenshots. Regenerated sections may appear in a different order and layout.", "sources": [{"role": "reference", "sha256": "f632d25b4184d4cfd8d237f8592f1be8d361fb6c33775dfb428bb01132e228ac", "headings": [{"level": "h2", "text": "Переходите в МТС со своим номером"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Тарифы"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Перейти в МТС"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Домашний интернет"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Услуги и опции"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Уже 5G"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Семейная группа"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "eSIM"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Роуминг"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Акции"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Смартфоны"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Наушники"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Часы"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Планшеты"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Защитник+"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Premium"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Нас касается"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "ТВ"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Деньги"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Развлечения"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Забота и помощь"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Страховки"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Инвестиции"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Тарифы"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Перейти в МТС"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Услуги и опции"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Домашний интернет"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Роуминг"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Интернет-магазин"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Уже 5G"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Семейная группа"}, {"level": "h3", "text": "Акции"}, {"level": "h2", "text": "Уже 5G"}, {"level": "h2", "text": "Подключайте МТС Junior"}, {"level": "h2", "text": "РИИЛ максимум связи"}, {"level": "h2", "text": "Скидка 33% на красивый номер"}, {"level": "h2", "text": "МТС Optimus напомнит, о чем дог